### ============================================================
### 21-SpringDataR2DBC Reactive API Testing (Port: 8121)
### ============================================================

### 1. Tạo sản phẩm mới (Reactive Mono<ProductDto>)
POST http://localhost:8121/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wireless Earbuds",
  "price": 89.99,
  "stock": 150
}

### 2. Lấy sản phẩm theo ID (Mono)
GET http://localhost:8121/products/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Lấy danh sách sản phẩm phân trang (Flux)
GET http://localhost:8121/products/paged?page=0&size=5
Accept: application/json

### 4. Tìm sản phẩm tồn kho thấp (@Query Reactive)
GET http://localhost:8121/products/low-stock?threshold=20
Accept: application/json

### 5. Tìm theo khoảng giá (DatabaseClient fluent query)
GET http://localhost:8121/products/price-range?min=50&max=200
Accept: application/json

### 6. Cập nhật tồn kho (DatabaseClient update fluent)
PUT http://localhost:8121/products/1/stock?stock=200
